  "CardDescription": {
    "LocalizationKey": "CMC_AcademyLectern_CardDescription",
    "DefaultText": "The academy masters lecture here. Drag Salt, metal Nuggets, or Duros Coins onto the lectern to fund your Tuition Account (holds up to 1000); each two-hour study session draws 100 from that balance (more while you are Wanted or Banished), including the final exam. Choose a subject below to advance its coursework; when only one session remains, sit the final exam to earn your degree. On the afternoons the Miller, Weaver, Apothecary or Professor is lecturing here, a Sit In button lets you listen in for a small boost to their craft, once a week for each."
  },
